  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: filter_dialog - make Cancel button functional",
  "description": "https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsug_html/#FiltersDialog  \nOK     - Saves the filter settings and closes the dialog.  \nCancel - Closes the dialog without saving any changes.  \n  \nNotes from !7722 which will be closed if logray code ok in this MR.  \nWorks properly when called from Capture/Display filter bookmark.  \nThis change duplicates that code.  \nWireshark change in !3251  \n  \nThe call from bookmark [display_filter_edit.cpp](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/ui/qt/widgets/display_filter_edit.cpp#L424):  \n```\n    QAction *manage_action = bb_menu->addAction(tr(\"Manage Display Filters\"));\n    connect(manage_action, &QAction::triggered, this, &DisplayFilterEdit::showFilters);\n\nvoid DisplayFilterEdit::showFilters()\n{\n    FilterDialog *display_filter_dlg = new FilterDialog(window(), FilterDialog::DisplayFilter);\n    display_filter_dlg->setWindowModality(Qt::ApplicationModal);\n    display_filter_dlg->setAttribute(Qt::WA_DeleteOnClose);\n    display_filter_dlg->show();\n}\n```",
  "state": "merged",
